":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-rail","data-dock-active":"false","style":{"top":"94px"}},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-dock","hidden":true},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored life-ad-space-compact","data-ad-placement":"ad_dock","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-ad-dismiss","aria-label":"Close ad"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-x","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 6 6 18"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 6 12 12"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_dock"},"children":["Explore the community and examples",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 7h10v10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 17 17 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Common legal pitfalls for programmers and tech professionals"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Before acting, ask whether the manufacturer, platform or company will report it to police; if criminal proceedings follow, contact a criminal defense lawyer immediately"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Do not make or sell game cheats and assistance tools, including AI assistance that “only reads the screen and never touches memory,” or modified software that adds features to apps such as WeChat"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Do not write or sell scripts for ticket snatching, flash sales, fake orders, or coupon farming — even if they merely “automate button clicks”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"The crawler only accesses publicly available pages that require no login; it does not attempt to bypass anti-scraping measures or handle any personal information, and any data it collects is never sold"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/11-05","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Refuse development orders for gambling, fraud, or adult-content apps; do not set up payment gateways or unblock accounts for such “clients”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Upon leaving a job, return all account access rights; do not delete databases, leave backdoors, or alter password protection systems — even if the employer owes you wages"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Do not take source code, client lists, or technical documents upon leaving; do not upload them to personal cloud drives or reuse them at new employers"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Do not run your own programs on others’ computers, servers, or cameras; do not use company machines for mining"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Testing someone else’s systems without written permission — “good intentions” and “reporting afterward” are not excuses"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Vulnerabilities must be reported per regulations; no details, exploit tools, or disclosure to foreign entities before patching"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"No selling of tools for bypassing firewalls or VPN accounts, no setting up such nodes for others"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"After signing a non-compete agreement, if the employer fails to pay compensation monthly, send a written notice; if payment still doesn’t come after 3 months, you may terminate the agreement. Workers who never handled any trade secrets can request that the clause be declared invalid"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Code written during work hours using company resources belongs to the company; personal open‑source projects should be done in your own time and on your own equipment, without mixing them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Using open-source code such as GPL in products: Open-source it per the license or switch licenses — don’t treat this as “no one cares”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Only collect personal data strictly necessary for the app’s operation; consent from guardians is required for users under 14, and the privacy policy must be clearly written"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Before launching a website or app, complete ICP registration and retain logs for at least 6 months per classification protection requirements"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Before offering generative AI services to the public, conduct required safety assessments and algorithm registration; mark all generated content"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Do not make or distribute tools that automatically skip or block other apps’ ads; free tools that work offline can still constitute unfair competition"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Do not set up an “AI proxy site” to resell foreign large-model API access cheaply: an operator in Shanghai has already been placed in criminal detention"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/11"},"children":["Chapter 11"," ·"," ","Common legal pitfalls for programmers and tech professionals"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"11-05"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["05"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Refuse development orders for gambling, fraud, or adult-content apps; do not set up payment gateways or unblock accounts for such “clients”"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Taking on such high-paying yet poorly defined projects means you could be treated as an accomplice in gambling crimes, facing charges under the crime of operating illegal gambling dens: up to 5 years in prison, or 5–10 years for serious cases. This is not the “merely helping out, maximum 3 years” category. In one e-sports betting app case, 28 developers in Hainan were sentenced to 1–3 years and 6 months for operating illegal gambling dens. Those who unblocked QQ accounts for fraud rings received 1 year and 6 months in prison plus a 20,000-yuan fine."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No direct monetary cost. The trade-off is forgoing outsour…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Providing technical support or payment settlement services to known online criminals can lead to imprisonment…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Refuse development orders for gambling, fraud, or adult-content apps; do not set up payment gateways or unblock accounts for such “clients”"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No direct monetary cost. The trade-off is forgoing outsourcing projects that pay well but have vague requirements. The difficulty lies in the fact that these clients often offer significantly higher pay than normal projects."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Providing technical support or payment settlement services to known online criminals can lead to imprisonment of up to 3 years and/or a fine, especially when the circumstances are serious. If other crimes are also involved, the harsher penalty applies. Operating illegal gambling dens carries up to 5 years in prison plus a fine; serious cases bring 5–10 years. Official examples: Zhangsheng Group developed gambling games and handled “online distribution,” earning fees for website setup and reporting; the total illicit revenue reached nearly 7 billion yuan. Its leader was sentenced to 9 years and 9 months plus a 50-million-yuan fine. 79 developers, including Wang Qiang, received sentences ranging from 6 months to 9 years and 9 months. In another case, 28 developers in Hainan who built an e-sports betting app were convicted of operating illegal gambling dens and received similar sentences, plus fines. One individual who ran a studio unblocking QQ accounts for fraudsters got 1 year and 6 months in prison and a 20,000-yuan fine (nationwide)."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大 (2020). 刑法（根据刑法修正案（十一）修正，第二百八十七条之二、第三百零三条第二款）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jtgl.beijing.gov.cn/jgj/jgxx/flfg/fl/11033925/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jtgl.beijing.gov.cn/jgj/jgxx/flfg/fl/11033925/index.html"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2023). 建赌博网站并出售，涉案近 70 亿元. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/zdgz/202307/t20230711_621248.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/zdgz/202307/t20230711_621248.shtml"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2022). 上海闵行区：办理一起新型开设网络赌场案. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/zdgz/202208/t20220805_569952.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/zdgz/202208/t20220805_569952.shtml"]},"；最高人民检察院 (2025). 依法惩治帮助信息网络犯罪活动及相关犯罪典型案例（案例一）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202507/t20250728_702377.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202507/t20250728_702377.shtml"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jtgl.beijing.gov.cn/jgj/jgxx/flfg/fl/11033925/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["“Knowing intent” does not require the client to explicitly state the purpose. When a quote is far above market rates, the app includes top-up, cash-out, and betting features, and the client refuses to disclose usage, these facts are used to prove you were aware of the illegal nature. Developers of gambling apps are prosecuted as accomplices in operating illegal gambling dens, not under the “Crime of Assisting Information Network Criminal Activities” which caps at 3 years."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/11-04"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"The crawler only accesses publicly available pages that require no login; it does not attempt to bypass anti-scraping measures or handle any personal information, and any data it collects is never sold"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/11-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Upon leaving a job, return all account access rights; do not delete databases, leave backdoors, or alter password protection systems — even if the employer owes you wages"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinej